{
  "app_id": 2393970,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "A zombie virus, airborne and with an incubation period lasting years , has suddenly swept across the entire world. Almost everyone is already infected. You are one of the rare few born immune to the pathogen. Do whatever it takes… survive . ● Realistic physics collisions: Outstanding hit feedback, and the armor no longer provides abstract defense values — instead, it physically covers the body surface to block incoming damage. ● Fully dynamic, completely destructible world: Terrain, buildings, trees, rocks—everything can be destroyed ! ● Insanely creative vehicle construction: Combine any building materials to create wildly imaginative mobile fortresses! Use Lua scripts for precision control over your vehicles—no coding experience? No problem, just plug and play. ● Extreme building freedom ● 10 randomly generated biomes: Forests, ruins, deserts, canyons, rainforests, snowfields… blending into one seamless, endless procedural world. ● Wide variety of firearms ● Powerful and diverse traps ● Intensely oppressive bosses “Watch out for the night hordes — they run fast !” Co-op is in full development… Coming soon."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
